><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Whole-body water immersion strategies as utilised in this&#xD;study can be prescribed post-resistance exercise for highly&#xD;trained athletes during an in-season competition phase,&#xD;posing little risk of attenuating muscular hypertrophy; with&#xD;the potential to accrue trivial increases in concentric-only&#xD;SJ height.</span
></p
></body
